{"seq":1,"slug":"subscription-usage-hybrid","title":"订阅与用量混合计费","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/tenant-metering-billing/billing-model/subscription-usage-hybrid","wordCount":2015,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"订阅与用量混合计费\">订阅与用量混合计费</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>纯按量计费让租户无法做预算（用量不可预测），纯订阅制让平台无法吃到增长的收益（客户用量翻十倍还是收一样的钱）。混合模型是两者妥协的产物：租户先买一个订阅（保底收入 + 可预测预算），订阅里包含一定额度（included quota），超出部分按量计费（overage）。这个模型今天是 SaaS 计费的主流形态——Stripe 的 Billing 产品、OpenMeter 与 Lago 这类开源的 usage-based billing 平台、以及 Metronome 这类专门的用量计费基础设施，核心都在表达这套语义。</p>\n<p>模型的数学形式很简单：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>amount</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>incl</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>overage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{amount} = P_{\\text{base}} + \\max(0,\\ q - Q_{\\text{incl}}) \\times p_{\\text{overage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">incl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是订阅基本费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>incl</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{incl}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">incl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是包含额度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 是本期实际用量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>overage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{overage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是超额单价。真正的问题全在这个公式之外：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>incl</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{incl}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">incl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 什么时候重置、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 从哪一段区间取值、以及当租户在同一账期内换了套餐时这条公式要跑几遍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"包含额度的重置语义\">包含额度的重置语义</h2><p>「包含额度每账期重置一次」听起来无歧义，但在实现层面至少有三种不同语义，它们对账单的影响在边界月份尤其明显：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>重置语义</th>\n<th>额度周期</th>\n<th>额度结转</th>\n<th>典型产品</th>\n<th>边界行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>严格账期对齐</td>\n<td>与账期完全重合</td>\n<td>不结转</td>\n<td>多数 SaaS</td>\n<td>账期起点额度立即回满</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立滚动周期</td>\n<td>与订阅起始日对齐</td>\n<td>不结转</td>\n<td>部分按年订阅</td>\n<td>额度周期与账期错位，需按天折算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可结转（rollover）</td>\n<td>账期</td>\n<td>未用量可积累 N 期</td>\n<td>少数产品</td>\n<td>需要额度余额账本，复杂度显著上升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>严格账期对齐</strong>是最常见也最简单的。它的隐患在账期边界时刻：如果额度在账期起点瞬间回满，而计量读数在封账前仍在回填（见 <a href=\"../usage-metering/meter-aggregation\">用量计量聚合</a>），那么上期的一笔迟到用量会撞上已经重置的额度，导致它被算成新期的用量并消耗新期额度。这个错误很隐蔽——总金额可能不变，但账单上「本期超额量」会无端变多。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是<strong>额度扣减必须挂靠用量的事件时间，而不是扣减发生的时间</strong>。实现上这意味着额度账本不是「一个计数器」，而是一段时间轴上按窗口划分的额度过账：每个计量窗口有一个对应的额度余量，该窗口的事件消耗该窗口的额度。跨窗口的迟到事件会消耗它本来所属窗口的额度，从而在上期产生一笔超额，这笔超额再经由补账通道进入下一账期。这条规则把「额度」从状态量变成了一个可按时间重算的函数，代价是实现复杂度上升，收益是迟到事件不会污染当期。</p>\n<p><strong>可结转额度</strong>引入了额度余额账本：未用完的额度成为一笔可结转资产，有到期时间。它的实现要点是结转额度的消耗顺序——通常约定「先消耗最早到期的额度」（FIFO by expiry），否则租户会同时持有额度余额与超额账单，这在商业上无法解释。注意结转额度在会计上近似于一笔负债，因此它不只是技术问题，涉及收入确认的口径，见 <a href=\"../invoice-generation/billing-cycle-invoice\">账期出账与账单生成</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超额定价的三种表达\">超额定价的三种表达</h2><p>包含额度之外的量怎么计价，有几种常见的商业设计，工程上必须把它们表达成不同的函数而不是同一种：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[本期用量 q] --&gt; C1{q ≤ Q_incl?}&#10;  C1 --&gt;|是| A[仅收订阅费 P_base]&#10;  C1 --&gt;|否| C2{超额定价方式}&#10;  C2 --&gt;|统一单价| U[&quot;overage = (q-Q_incl) × p&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt;|阶梯累进| T[&quot;分段函数&lt;br/&gt;见 2_tiered-quota-billing&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt;|包断| F[&quot;取 min(overage, cap)&quot;]&#10;  U --&gt; R[应计金额]&#10;  T --&gt; R&#10;  F --&gt; R\">graph TD\n  Q[本期用量 q] --&gt; C1{q ≤ Q_incl?}\n  C1 --&gt;|是| A[仅收订阅费 P_base]\n  C1 --&gt;|否| C2{超额定价方式}\n  C2 --&gt;|统一单价| U[\"overage = (q-Q_incl) × p\"]\n  C2 --&gt;|阶梯累进| T[\"分段函数&lt;br/&gt;见 2_tiered-quota-billing\"]\n  C2 --&gt;|包断| F[\"取 min(overage, cap)\"]\n  U --&gt; R[应计金额]\n  T --&gt; R\n  F --&gt; R</pre><p><strong>统一单价</strong>最容易理解也最容易被租户接受，缺点是它无法体现规模经济——大客户用量越大应享受越低单价。</p>\n<p><strong>阶梯累进</strong>把超额部分再分段计价，单价随用量降低。它的表达必须落到 <a href=\"tiered-quota-billing\">阶梯/超额/配额计费</a> 定义的阶梯函数上，本篇不重复其数学，只强调一点：包含额度与阶梯的第一段是<strong>复合关系而非替代关系</strong>。常见的错误实现是「用量超过包含额度后就从阶梯第二段开始计价」，而正确的实现是「包含额度抵扣掉阶梯前若干档的量」。二者的金额差异在包含额度很大时非常显著。</p>\n<p>**包断（cap）**给超额设置上限，超出上限不再计费。它对租户是保护，对平台是风险——如果上限设得太低而超额单价很高，租户会用满上限然后无限使用。因此包断必须与配额拦截联动：到达上限后要么停止服务，要么继续服务但不计费（这等于给了无限量，通常只在极少数大客户合同中作为让步出现）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"金额表示与舍入纪律\">金额表示与舍入纪律</h2><p>混合计费把两种性质不同的金额加在一起，这暴露了一个必须尽早确立的纪律：<strong>金额必须用最小货币单位的整数表示</strong>。</p>\n<p>基本费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常来自价目表，本身就是整分。超额量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>incl</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q - Q_{\\text{incl}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">incl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是整数用量（或定点小数），乘以单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>overage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{overage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时会产生小数。若单价是「每千次调用 0.3 元」，则 1234 次调用的费用是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.234</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3702</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.234 \\times 0.3 = 0.3702</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.234</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3702</span></span></span></span></span> 元，即 37.02 分——出现了分的小数部分。</p>\n<p>三种舍入策略，必须显式选定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>对租户</th>\n<th>对平台</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总额一次舍入</td>\n<td>所有明细累加后按最近分舍入</td>\n<td>最公平</td>\n<td>误差随机分布</td>\n<td>推荐默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐项向上舍入</td>\n<td>每条明细独立向上取整</td>\n<td>略不利</td>\n<td>略有利</td>\n<td>小额高频计费项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐项向下舍入</td>\n<td>每条明细独立向下取整</td>\n<td>略有利</td>\n<td>略不利</td>\n<td>促销期让利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键纪律是<strong>舍入只发生一次，且发生在最终的总额上</strong>。如果每个中间步骤都舍入，误差会累积，且会出现「明细之和 ≠ 总额」这种财务上不可接受的账单——这在审计时是硬性失败项，见 <a href=\"../quota-enforcement/billing-reconcile-audit\">计费对账与审计</a>。多币种场景下舍入还要考虑币种的最小单位不同（日元没有小数位、某些币种有三位小数），见 <a href=\"../invoice-generation/multi-currency-billing\">多币种多市场出账</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合模型的实现骨架\">混合模型的实现骨架</h2><p>把以上约束落到实现，混合计费的出账对单个租户单个账期是一个纯函数：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  P[价目版本&lt;br/&gt;见 3_price-plan-version] --&gt; F[计费函数]&#10;  U[账期用量读数&lt;br/&gt;按窗口] --&gt; F&#10;  S[订阅状态变更&lt;br/&gt;升降级时间点] --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; D[明细行&lt;br/&gt;含额度扣减与超额]&#10;  D --&gt; SUM[汇总 + 一次舍入]&#10;  SUM --&gt; INV[账单&lt;br/&gt;见 3_invoice-generation]\">graph LR\n  P[价目版本&lt;br/&gt;见 3_price-plan-version] --&gt; F[计费函数]\n  U[账期用量读数&lt;br/&gt;按窗口] --&gt; F\n  S[订阅状态变更&lt;br/&gt;升降级时间点] --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; D[明细行&lt;br/&gt;含额度扣减与超额]\n  D --&gt; SUM[汇总 + 一次舍入]\n  SUM --&gt; INV[账单&lt;br/&gt;见 3_invoice-generation]</pre><p>这个函数的必须属性是<strong>幂等与可重放</strong>：给定相同的（价目版本、用量读数、变更历史），任何时刻重跑都必须得到完全相同的金额。这条属性是第三章对账与第四章审计的前提，也决定了实现上不能依赖「当前时刻」这类不可重放的输入——所有「现在」都必须作为参数传入。这条纪律的具体形态在 <a href=\"price-plan-version\">计费套餐版本化</a> 与 <a href=\"../quota-enforcement/billing-reconcile-audit\">计费对账与审计</a> 中各有展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>混合计费的公式本身很简单，复杂度全部在包含额度的重置语义上。</li>\n<li>额度扣减必须挂靠用量的事件时间而非扣减发生时间，否则迟到事件会污染当期账单。</li>\n<li>可结转额度等价于一笔负债，需要额度余额账本与到期消耗顺序（通常按到期时间 FIFO）。</li>\n<li>包含额度与阶梯计费是复合关系：额度抵扣阶梯前若干档的量，而非从阶梯第二段起算。</li>\n<li>金额必须用最小货币单位整数表示，舍入只发生一次且在最终总额上，否则明细之和会不等于总额。</li>\n<li>计费函数必须是（价目版本，用量读数，变更历史）的纯函数，任何依赖「当前时刻」的实现都不可重放。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"订阅与用量混合计费","id":"订阅与用量混合计费"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"包含额度的重置语义","id":"包含额度的重置语义"},{"level":2,"text":"超额定价的三种表达","id":"超额定价的三种表达"},{"level":2,"text":"金额表示与舍入纪律","id":"金额表示与舍入纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"混合模型的实现骨架","id":"混合模型的实现骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计量准确性与去重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/tenant-metering-billing/usage-metering/meter-accuracy-dedup"},"next":{"title":"阶梯、超额与配额计费","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/tenant-metering-billing/billing-model/tiered-quota-billing"}}